│ │                                │ assistant: Now I have the      │        │ │
│ │                                │ picture. Let me analyze the    │        │ │
│ │                                │ data more carefully.           │        │ │
│ │                                │                                │        │ │
│ │                                │ Each machine has a `part`      │        │ │
│ │                                │ (like part_0, part_1, etc.)    │        │ │
│ │                                │ and a `repair_stage`. The      │        │ │
│ │                                │ machines start at stage 0.     │        │ │
│ │                                │ Tools are compatible with      │        │ │
│ │                                │ certain parts at certain       │        │ │
│ │                                │ stages. This is a repair chain │        │ │
│ │                                │ - we need to progress each     │        │ │
│ │                                │ machine through stages until   │        │ │
│ │                                │ it's fully repaired.           │        │ │
│ │                                │                                │        │ │
│ │                                │ Let me figure out which        │        │ │
│ │                                │ machines are "critical" and    │        │ │
│ │                                │ figure out the repair chains.  │        │ │
│ │                                │                                │        │ │
│ │                                │ [tool call]                    │        │ │
│ │                                │ {                              │        │ │
│ │                                │   "name": "python",            │        │ │
│ │                                │   "args": "{\"code\": \"from   │        │ │
│ │                                │ ptc import task, tools,        │        │ │
│ │                                │ finish\\n\\n# Build a          │        │ │
│ │                                │ comprehensive picture of what  │        │ │
│ │                                │ we know\\n# Each machine has a │        │ │
│ │                                │ part type. Let me organize by  │        │ │
│ │                                │ part.\\n\\nmachines_by_part =  │        │ │
│ │                                │ {}\\nmachines =                │        │ │
│ │                                │ [\\\"machine_\\\" + str(i) for │        │ │
│ │                                │ i in range(16)]\\nfor m in     │        │ │
│ │                                │ machines:\\n    s =            │        │ │
